- Cardiovascular: Regular rate and rhythm, no jugular venous distension, no carotid bruits, no murmurs.
- Respiratory: Clear to auscultation bilaterally.
- Musculoskeletal: Reports lower extremity swelling, pitting edema 1+ on the right radial artery.
