- Renal Artery Ultrasound: Ordered to assess for secondary causes of kidney disease.
- Blood Work: Ordered to monitor kidney function and electrolyte levels.
- Follow-up: Follow-up in 3 months.

**Patient Agreement:**
The patient understands and agrees with the recommended treatment plan. }}<|eot_id|>
